WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.769
Ringo and Bot were in the gym.

2
00:00:06.770 --> 00:00:09.780
Ringo ran on a machine.

3
00:00:09.781 --> 00:00:15.208
He was huffing and puffing.

4
00:00:15.209 --> 00:00:21.116
Bot was whistling a tune.

5
00:00:21.117 --> 00:00:27.926
Lucy walked by and laughed.

6
00:00:27.927 --> 00:00:30.971
"You're not just little, Tiny.

7
00:00:30.972 --> 00:00:32.991
You're out of shape.

8
00:00:32.992 --> 00:00:38.314
And so is your junk robot!" "Watch

9
00:00:38.315 --> 00:00:43.167
this!" Ringo said. He

10
00:00:43.168 --> 00:00:47.755
ran faster. "I'm

11
00:00:47.756 --> 00:00:51.213
getting in shape now!" Ringo

12
00:00:51.214 --> 00:01:04.504
ran fast until Lucy was gone. Then

13
00:01:04.505 --> 00:01:08.967
he hopped off the machine. Ringo

14
00:01:08.968 --> 00:01:11.362
bent over. He

15
00:01:11.363 --> 00:01:15.752
was out of breath. "Whew!

16
00:01:15.753 --> 00:01:19.768
I hate working out!" "You

17
00:01:19.769 --> 00:01:23.596
should stop and rest," Bot said. Ringo

18
00:01:23.597 --> 00:01:26.521
shook his head. "I'm

19
00:01:26.522 --> 00:01:32.708
the smallest rookie on the base. I

20
00:01:32.709 --> 00:01:38.263
need to be strong for Space Patrol." Ringo

21
00:01:38.264 --> 00:01:43.266
started running again. He

22
00:01:43.267 --> 00:01:46.838
saw Lucy across the room. She

23
00:01:46.839 --> 00:01:51.212
was doing lots of exercise. Ringo

24
00:01:51.213 --> 00:01:56.902
sighed. "Lucy is in great shape." Bot shrugged.

25
00:01:56.903 --> 00:02:01.848
"You're good at fixing robots." "Thanks, Bot,"

26
00:02:01.849 --> 00:02:05.136
Ringo said. "But—" Beep! Ringo

27
00:02:05.137 --> 00:02:11.254
looked

28
00:02:11.255 --> 00:02:13.687
at his phone. He had

29
00:02:13.688 --> 00:02:15.740
a new message. The message

30
00:02:15.741 --> 00:02:18.498
was from Captain Nova. Come to

31
00:02:18.499 --> 00:02:28.071
my office — right now!

